  "faqFreeVersion": "Can I use it for free?",
  "faqFreeVersionAnswer": "Yes. Free includes intention paths, 2 custom habits, 2 focus areas, weekly reflections, smart notifications, and widgets.",
  "faqRestore": "How do I restore my purchase?",
  "faqRestoreAnswer": "Profile → Restore Purchases.",
  "faqCancel": "How do I cancel?",
  "faqCancelAnswer": "iPhone Settings → your name → Subscriptions → Intended → Cancel.",
  "faqSectionPrivacy": "Privacy",
  "faqDataStorage": "Where is my data stored?",
  "faqDataStorageAnswer": "Your moments live on your device first. If you sign in, they're also backed up to your private account so a new phone can restore them — that includes mood taps and notes. No one else can see them, and deleting your account deletes the backup.",
  "faqDataSelling": "Does Intended sell my data?",
  "faqDataSellingAnswer": "No. We use anonymous crash reports to fix bugs. Never your habit data.",
  "faqDeleteApp": "What if I delete the app?",
  "faqDeleteAppAnswer": "Data is local, so deleting removes everything. Subscriptions can be restored through the App Store.",
  "faqSectionTroubleshooting": "Troubleshooting",
  "faqCrash": "The app crashed.",
  "faqCrashAnswer": "Try closing and reopening. Make sure you have the latest version.",
  "faqHabitsGone": "My habits disappeared.",
  "faqHabitsGoneAnswer": "Try restarting. If they don't return, contact support@intendedapp.com.",
  "faqAppleName": "Apple Sign-In isn't showing my name.",
  "faqAppleNameAnswer": "Apple only sends your name the first time. Go to iPhone Settings → Apple ID → Password & Security → Apps Using Apple ID → Intended → Stop Using, then sign in again.",
  "faqNotificationsNotArriving": "Notifications aren't arriving.",
  "faqNotificationsNotArrivingAnswer": "Check that notifications are enabled for Intended in iPhone Settings → Notifications. Also make sure Background App Refresh is on. If you recently reinstalled, open the app once so it can reschedule reminders.",
